In the days of our Grandfather's Grandfathers, our Great Empire was divided between the usurping warlords of the East and We in the West who still reign under Divine Decree.
The True Empire in the West is now under siege by the Fryhtan hordes.  They have emerged from beyond our (Southern) Marches and are now steadily and inexorably crushing all that we can throw before them.
Although it would seem that there is no possible way to stop this onslaught, it is said by some that by acquiring renegade Fryhtans or, perhaps, some of their demonic weapons, we may be able to gain enough of an advantage to stem their advance.
It is unlikely that we can expect any assistance from the East as they perceive that it is to their advantage for us to fall.

In the event that we are able to defeat the Fryhtans, it will become your sacred duty to launch a Great Crusade with the goal of overthrowing the Eastern usurpers and re-creating the Old Empire.
